    "statement": "(Item 30) O número de grupos de trabalho que podem ser formados com, pelo menos, uma pessoa do sexo feminino é igual a 4.753. RASCUNHO Analista de Tecnologia da Informação Text for the items from 31 to 35. Technology has revolutionized the way healthcare is delivered, especially in the nursing profession. Nurses now have access to advanced tools and systems that help them provide better patient care. One of the most significant advancements is electronic health records (EHR), which allow nurses to easily access patient information, track medications, and communicate with other healthcare providers. Additionally, technologies like telehealth and remote monitoring enable nurses to care for patients from a distance, increasing access to healthcare for many people. Overall, technology has enhanced efficiency, accuracy, and quality of care in the nursing field. I Technology has improved patient care in the nursing field by providing access to EHR, enabling easier tracking of medications, and facilitating communication with other healthcare providers. II Some examples of advanced technologies that nurses now have access to include EHR, telehealth services, and remote monitoring systems. Considering the ideas expressed in the text, judge the sentences below.",
